<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ḡalasia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Neletes Namun Pol Hiy Ige Taḡalasia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ḡalasia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kal</para>
  <para style="rem">(Translated by Fr. John)</para>
  <para style="mt">Neletes Namun Pol Hiy Ige Taḡalasia</para>
  <para style="is">Nēdēmdēm ne hohole m̄ey am̄ag</para>
  <para style="ip">Nōbōk gōh neletes vitwag a Pol mayap van hiy ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ Ḡalasia. Ḡalasia, kē mahē liwo, tō lepnō nam̄adeg alon en. Net bavanvantēy hal mavan tey neletes vel ēm̄ yon̄ del Ḡalasia.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pol nēglal galsi ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ anen. Nōbōk a Namgumgu Namun Ige Hal en, kē nihole gatay qeleave Pol mavatēp mahē nan. Nakaka nan kē hagtō van letvēlgi 16 wa 18. Pol kē motog tō van Ḡalasia am̄ag ba veg kē mogom. Gēn et ēglal galsi te so kē mogom bahap, ba wun namtan mehet. Mahē a Pol mogom en, tō kē nihole gatay noyoy ēwē. Ige et mey a mēdēmtig en, Pol mavan me qeleso imam nonoy, kēy ōl so ‘imam yon̄.’ Pol mavatne bah noyoy ēwē en, tō kē nivan yak botoytoy lepnō tegtegha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lōbōk gōh en, Pol nihole gatay noyoy ēwē. Ba noyoy ēwē nan nahap? Noyoy ēwē en namtehal mey a Ḡod tavaēh gēn aē. Namtehal nan heylō nohoghog mamah nonon. Pol vap so gēn del et sey te so Ḡod nivaēh gēn, ba Ḡod tavaēh gēn bemgaysēn nonon ēwē. Mahē Ḡod nivaēh net vitwag en, et beyseyse te bemgumgu ēwē a kē mak tō, tateh. Ba Ḡod tavaēh kē veg Ḡod natam kē. Tigsas mahgen mak namtehal a so nivaēh gēn heylō namgumgu nonon ēwē. Meygōh nohoghog mamah nonon. Nēdēmdēm nan Pol ōl so “nasgōp non Ḡod.” Ḡod tavaēh net mey a nēdēmtig kē besgōp.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ige dēmtig a Ḡalasia, kēy et Juw te. Mahē Pol nivatvatgo kēy veg Kraēs en, kē et vatvatgo te kēy Bele non ige Juw. Tō Pol niōl kēy so ‘ige lolqōn̄.’ Qiyig gēn hole gatay ige lolqōn̄ en, nēdēmdēm nan so ige m̄ey et Krēstēn te. Ba mahē a Pol nihole gatay nohohole nen, kē nihole gatay ige a et Juw te. Tō kē mōl van hiy ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ Ḡalasia so ige lolqōn̄, ba ikēy Nēkrēstēn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ige vatgo tegtegha, kēy mavatēp Ḡalasia. Yatkel vatgo itōk, ba yatkel vatgo nehet. Yatkel vatvatgo het mavap van hiy kēy so kēy so dam nēvēnan ige Juw. Kēy mavap so ige lolqōn̄ tit dam vēhte Tigsas so kēy wo et van te me qele ige Juw. Kēy vap so kēy so tep vēglal kēy, wa itōk so kēy dēmlok nōqōn̄ yon̄ non ige Juw.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ige vatvatgo het en, kēy mohole hethet hiy Pol. Kēy mavap so et hēywē te a so Pol nahal vitwag en. Tō kēy mavap so nohohole nonoy nēdēw veteg nohohole non Pol veg ikēy nage Tejerusalem. Tō kēy mavap so Pol et hole gatay te nēvēnan ige Juw veg kē nemyōs so ige Taḡalasia et buste noyoy ēwē.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pol kē mayap neletes nan so nivatne ige Taḡalasia boyoy ēwē wa niak m̄ōleg van so nēdēmdēm nan qeleave.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Pol mavap namlaklak nonon van hiy ige Taḡalasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Den Pol, nahal non Tigsas Kraēs. Ige et et vētleg te no. Et net ēwē te a mēvētleg no, ba Ḡod Imam mey a mak ēh lok Tigsas Kraēs en, kōyō mēvētleg no. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Wa tō den ige yathēthēngēn a tog tiwag tō mi no agōh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">Hiy kimi lēm̄ yon̄ del Taḡalasia.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Nasgōp wa natm̄at non Imam Ḡod tiwag mi Welan nongēn Tigsas Kraēs, notogtog tiwag mi kimi. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Tigsas ikē a mukēg nēh nonon so nilep yak nēvēvēg begengenyeg nongēn, tō nivaēh gēn den namyam het gōh, tatag van lemyōs non Ḡod Imam nongēn. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />!Mogmogo wa ōliwo lap kē vaga! Qeleanen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nitiy yoy ēwē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />!No mamamakē nowmat veg a kimi metgotgo so tig kēlē Ḡod en, kē mōlōl kimi mi nasgōp non Kraēs! !Ba kimi mal at nangomi van loyoy ēwē tegha! <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Ba tateh yoy ēwē mey netegha se. Ba ige et vivitwag mak tēqtēqyeg kimi, kēy nemyōs so leh hethet noyoy ēwē non Kraēs. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />!Yēhē! !Kemem si so nin̄sel vitwag den alge wo motoytoy noyoy ēwē vitwag mey a netegha den mey a kemem mal vasemlō vatag van hiy kimi en, kē tavan lep! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Qeleso kemem mohohole tō am̄ag, tō nok hole lokse. So net vitwag wo nitoytoy noyoy ēwē vitwag hiy kimi mey a netegha den noyoy ēwē a kimi melep vatag en, kē tavan lep.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />?Wō kimi dēm van so nok so ak malaklak hē, ige sil siso Ḡod? No nemyōs so Ḡod nimlaklak. ?Kimi dēm van so nok soksok ige sil so mōyōs no? Tateh. Sowo nok wo mugumgu so ak malaklak ēwē net en, namanig nan no et yowyowveg non Kraēs te.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol nikaka veg qeleave Ḡod melep van hiy kē noyoy ēwē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Yēhē yathithik wa yatētētek, itōk so nok vap m̄ōleg van hiy kimi. Noyoy ēwē a nok vavasemlō tō van hiy kimi en, net et qētēg te tō. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Wa tō nok et lep te noyoy ēwē gōh den net tegha, wa tō net et vatne te no aē. Ba Tigsas Kraēs mahgen a mavasemlō me hiy no noyoy ēwē agōh.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Namtevuk me am̄ag en nehet, qele kimi mal yon̄teg vatag nakaka nan. Lamahē nen, nok tatag nēvēnan ige Juw so mogmogo Ḡod. Vaga en nok damdamti ige et tēlēm̄ yon̄ non Ḡod so wuh kēy, a tateh magaysēn geh mi no. Vaga nok ak etgal so bun veteg nēm̄ yon̄ nan. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />No mam̄agoy nōlōwlō Tujuw nehep den ige a kemem mowotwot tiwag tō, veg navaksek aē bitigtig maymay lēvēnamem.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ba Ḡod mal vonyak vatag no, mahē a no lapgetō van lelo taqan tita mino. Tō kē mōlōl no heylō van lesgōp nonon. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Wa tō kē maklō Ēntēn me hiy no, so nok vasemlō noyoy ēwē veg kē van hiy ige lolqōn̄. Ba nok et yōstiwag hōn te tiwag mi net aē, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />wa nok et van te Jerusalem so et ige a kēy nahal am̄ag den no, tateh. Ba no mavan ēgē n̄a Arabia, tō me atgiy en, nok van lokse me Damaskus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arabia en vētmahē liwo mey a qiyig gōh ige ōl so Sinai Peninsula. Damaskus en, napnō liwo non ige lolqōn̄.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Tō lēkle ētē vētēl en, no mavan hay Jerusalem so et Pita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pol niōlōl nahan Pita so ‘Sephas.’</char></note>. Tō no motog nōqōn̄ son̄wul nanm̄e tēvēlēm tiwag mi Pita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Acts 9:26-30</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Ba no et etsas te ige hal yatkelgi. No met ēwē Jemes a ēthēn Welan Tigsas. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />!Lengon Ḡod, vel hohole mino hēyhēywē, ba et galgal te! <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Lēkle qōn̄ nen, no mavan n̄a Siria wa Silisia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siria wa Silisia, vētmahē vōyō non ige lolqōn̄.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Lamahē nen, ige sil tēlēm̄ yon̄ non Kraēs n̄a Judea, kēy et ēglal qete no. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Kēy moyon̄teg ēwē noyoy veg no, tō kēy vasem so, “Net gōh, kē mak tōqtōqyeg tō gēn so niak sisgoy nēdēmtig nongēn. Ba togtōkē kē nitoytoy bēdēmtig nan ēgēn.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Tō kēy melep kal nahan Ḡod veg no.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Ige hal hohole veg ige lolqōn̄, so kēy so tatag namtevōn ige Juw si tateh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1-2" />Lēkle ēte son̄wul nanm̄e vēvet, Ḡod mavasemlō me so nok so van n̄a Jerusalem. Tō kamyō Banabas mavan me Jerusalem. Tō Titus madam kamyō.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Acts 11:30</char></note> Tō kamtēl mōyōstiwag tiwag mi ige m̄agoy ne ēm̄ yon̄. Kamtēl mōyōstiwag mi kēy ēwē veg, so kēy wo et buste notoytoy mino en, tō no tiple mugumgu yeghuquy ēwē. Tō no mavasemlō m̄ōleg noyoy ēwē mey a nok toytoy van hiy ige mey et Juw te. Tō kēy mēwēhgoy.<verse eid="GAL 2:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ipluk a Titus en, ikē nage Tikrik, ba kēy et vap maymay te van hiy kē so tep vēglal kē tatag van lēvēnan ige Juw.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nēvēnan ige Juw so tep vēglal ige nētnētm̄ey tam̄an del tatag van nele non Mosis. Tō ige mey et Juw te mey nemyōs so mogmogo tiwag mi ige Juw en, ige Juw nemyōs so tep vēglal se kēy.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Nohohole bēvēglal gōh mavan me den yatkel et a kēy galgal goy so kēy yaplōplōn gēn. Ige gōh metvēy lēm̄ yon̄ so halhalveg bat gēn. Kēy nemyōs so etsas so Tigsas Kraēs mak taywah gēn qeleave, veg kēy nemyōs so lēg maymay gēn tō so gēn tatag lokse nēmētwōn ige Juw. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ba kemem mitig maymay so gatgoy kēy, veg kemem nemyōs yeh so etgoy galsi nohohole hēyhēywē van loyoy ēwē en, tō so kimi telep galsi vēh.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Ba ige m̄agoy ne ēm̄ yon̄ en, nahay aē a so kēy et lililwo. Ba no et dēmdēm te aē veg kēy so kēy so et liwo si tateh. Veg van lengon Ḡod, ige del haytēyēh vēlēs. Ba ige et lililwo gōh, kēy et leh te noyoy ēwē namuk. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Kēy met van so Ḡod mal m̄ōk no so nok vasemlō noyoy ēwē gōh van hiy ige lolqōn̄, qele kē mōm̄ōk tō Pita so nivasemlō noyoy ēwē van hiy ige Juw. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Ḡod mōm̄ōk kal no mi namaymay nonon, so nok van me nahal non ige lolqōn̄, qele kē mōm̄ōk kal tō Pita so kē nahal non ige Tisrael. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Ige m̄agoy ne ēm̄ yon̄ Jerusalem en wa, Jemes, Pita, ba Jon. Kēytēl met vēglal nasgōp a Ḡod melep me hiy no. Tō kēytēl van me tō ol namneytēl me hiy no tiwag mi Banabas, veg kēytēl met van so kemem haytēyēh vēlēs. Tō kemem movonm̄ēt hōw so vēlwoy namgumgu, kamyō toytoy namun mamyō hiy ige lolqōn̄, bastō kēytēl toytoy namuytēl hiy ige Juw. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Tō ige hal mavap me hiy kamyō so kamyō dēmsas ige m̄asay, bastō so biyin̄ kēy. Ba no mal dēmsas vatag kēy, tō no nemyōs so ak namgumgu qeleanen.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol mohole maymay van hiy Pita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Mahē a Pita mavan me Antiok en, tō nok van me tō tig van lengon, tō hole maymay van hiy kē, veg kē mak nage mey a et tenenen te.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Acts 15:2</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Veg am̄ag, Pita itōk tō. Kē megengen tiwag tō mi ige non Tigsas mey a et Juw te. Ba me atgiy en, Jemes nivētleg me yatkel et Tejerusalem so nivatēp kemem. Mahē a kēy mēdēn̄ me nen, tō Pita nibah gengen tiwag mi ige mey et Juw te. Pita mabah gengen veg kē memtēgteg ige viwti mey a nemyōs so tetep vēglal ige mey et Juw te. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Tō ige yaplōplōngēn Tujuw, kēy madam nēmētwuge het nen, tiwag mi Banabas se.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Tō no met van so kēy et tatag te nēmētwuge mey netnenen, a tatag nohohole hēyhēywē van loyoy ēwē. Tō no mohole maymay van hiy Pita aē van lengoy del. No mavap so, “?Bahap tō nēk vasōsōp ige mey et Juw te so kēy tatag namtevōn ige Juw? Veg inēk Nujuw, ba nēk et tatag te namtevōn ige Juw; nēk tatag namtevōn ige mey et Juw te.”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nele Tisrael tit vaēh vēhte net</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />No mavasemlō galgalsi lokse van hiy Pita, so kamyō et net helhele non ige lolqōn̄ te, ba kamyō nitiy et Tisrael. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Tō kamyō nēglal vatag so nēmētwuge tit m̄ōk togolgol vēhte net vitwag van lengon Ḡod, so kē wo matatag tō Nele. Ba net a nidēmtig Tigsas Kraēs en, kē nen a Ḡod tet van so kē netgolgol lengon. Tō kamyō mēdēmtig Tigsas Kraēs, so m̄ōk togolgol kamyō van lengon Ḡod. Tō kamyō netgolgol heylō nēdēmtig nan, ba et heylō te namgumgu tatag Nele. Veg namgumgu mey net nimgumgu tatag Nele en, namgumgu nan et haytēyēh hōn te so net nan nitgolgol tiwag mi Ḡod.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Togtōkē gēn matēg van hiy Kraēs so gēn netgolgol. So gēn wo galeg nahap mey Tigsas mōlvayēg en, ba nim̄ōleg so gēn wo gengenyeg aē en, tō namanig nan so Kraēs mavahiy gēn so gēn so gengenyeg. Ba et qele te nen. !Tigsas et net begengenyeg te!<verse eid="GAL 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Am̄ag no mavan yak tō den namtehal ne Le tō so dam namtehal non Kraēs. So namtehal ne Le nan, no wo madam lokse, tō nēmētwuk tavasem so no net begengenyeg.<verse eid="GAL 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />?Ba qeleave no mavan m̄ōleg den Nele? Tatag van nēdēmdēm alon Nele en, no mal mat vatag aē. Qeleso kēy mowos kal no lowolwol tiwag mi Kraēs. Veg no mal mat en, nēvēvēg ne Le mabah, tō togtōkē no mēh so ak malaklak Ḡod. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Togtōkē, et ino te a nok tog ēhēh tō agōh, ba nēh non Kraēs notog tiwag mi no. Nataqn̄ik a nēh a nok tog tēy tō qiyig gōh en, nok ēh mi nēdēmtig hiy Ēntēn Ḡod, veg kē natam no wa tō kē mukēg nēh nonon veg no, tō kē mavaēh no. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />No tit suwyeg yak vēhte nasgōp non Ḡod. Veg sowo net vitwag tetgolgol vēh van lengon Ḡod a kē natatag Nele en, tō namanig nan so Kraēs mamat yeghuquy ēwē.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Namtehal vōyō, vitwag Bele, vitwag bēdēmtig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />!Yēhē Taḡalasia! !Kimi naqaqa! ?Ba qeleave? ?Yatkel et magal kimi mi naman? !Ba kimi moyon̄teg vēglal galsi so kēy mowos kal Tigsas Kraēs lowolwol! <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Nok so vēhge nēvēvēhiy vitwag ēwē van hiy kimi. ?Qeleave? ?Kimi melep Nuvu Yon̄ am̄ag veg a kimi matatag tō Nele en, siso kimi moyon̄teg noyoy ēwē tō kimi mēdēmtig kē? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />!Et wē te! ?Kimi mal qētēg mi naman ne Vu Yon̄, ba tō kimi so ak qētqēt mi nētnegay nonmi? !Tateh! <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />?Nahaphap del a kimi mavan heylō en, kē yeghuquy ēwē? Nok et dēmdēm te qelenen. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Bastō nok so vēhge lokse kimi, ?Wō Ḡod nileplep van Nuvu nonon hiy kimi wa tō kē niakak naphah van lengomi, veg kimi matatag Nele ēwē ōk? ?Siso veg kimi moyon̄teg tō dēmtig kē, <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />qeleso Abraham mēdēmtig Ḡod en, tō Ḡod met lolwē kē so kē netnenen van lengon?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 15:6</char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Sōwlē, kimi so ēglal galsi so mahē a net nidēmtig Ḡod qele Abraham en, ikē ēntēn Abraham. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Nayapyap Yon̄ melgēlgēg so Ḡod tak togolgol ige lolqōn̄ van lengon heylō nēdēmtig. Veg Layapyap Yon̄ en, Ḡod mohoyhoylō noyoy ēwē van hiy Abraham mi nohohole so, “No tavawē ige sil del lemyam heylō nēk.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 12:3, 18:18, 22:18</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Bastō ihēte wo nēdēmtig Ḡod en, Ḡod tavawē kēy tiwag mi Abraham a kē net bēdēmtig.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ihēte mey mamatēg van lemgumgu Bele en, nivipdeg taqal kē. Veg Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so, “Ḡod tivipdeg ige del mey a kēy et tatag vaga te vel haphap a kēy mayap vatag lōbōk Nele en.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Deuteronomy 27:26</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Tō Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so, “Net wo motog tenenen van lengon Ḡod en, kē mamatēg ēwē van hiy nēdēmtig.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Habakkuk 2:4</char></note> Tō nohohole gōh nim̄ōleg galsi so net wo matatag Nele en, kē et tenenen te van lengon Ḡod. <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Ba Nele netegha den nēdēmtig, qele Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so “Net wo nidam tatag nele en, kē tēh aē.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Leviticus 18.5</char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Ba Kraēs mal wēl yak gēn, tō kē melep yak gēn den nivipdeg ne Le. Kē melep nivipdeg veg gēn qele a Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so, “Nivipdeg maymay taqal ihēte a kē nimat apwo qētēnge vitwag.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Deuteronomy 21:23</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Ba togtōkē, ige lolqōn̄ telep vēh navawē non Abraham heylō Tigsas Kraēs, ak tō so gēn telep vēh Nuvu mey a Ḡod mavatvat tō me hiy gēn heylō nēdēmtig.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham mavasemlō namtehal ne dēmtig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Yathithik wa yatētētek, dēm tatag tow van bēvēnangēn, a bavatvat. So yoge vōyō wo mavatvat bahapqiyig te, tō kōyō vonm̄ēt bah, ba net tegha tit yapsesey vēhte navatvat noyō si nim̄ōk leh van nēdēmdēm tegha van lavatvat nan. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Ba Ḡod mavatvat van hiy Abraham kōyō bōbō gēpgēp nonon. Nohohole gōh et vap te so “hiy ige bōbō gēpgēp,” qeleso kēy nam̄adeg. Ba mavap so, “hiy bōbō gēpgēp nonon,” nēdēmdēm nan so net vitwag ēwē, net nan a Kraēs en. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Nēdēmdēm ne hohole mino en, qelegēn. Am̄ag, Ḡod mavatvat, tō lēkle ētē m̄eldēl vag vēt son̄wul tēl (430) en, Nele qoyo kalō me. Ba Nele gōh tit yapsesey vēhte navatvat agōh, wa tō tit lepyak vēhte nohohole non Ḡod. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />So Ḡod wo melep me nahaphap hiy gēn, veg gēn natatag Nele en, tō nēdēmdēm nan so navatvat non Ḡod mal bah ēgēn. Ba Ḡod mohole vētday vel haphap van hiy Abraham heylō navatvat nonon veg nasgōp.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nele mavan me qeleave</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Qeleave Nele? Ḡod mōm̄ōk vaqlēh Nele veg negengenyeg. Ba Nele gōh totog dēn̄ mahē a bōbō gēpgēp nivan me, kē a Ḡod mavatvat tō aē am̄ag. Nele gōh, Ḡod melep van hiy ige in̄sel tō kēy lep van hiy net vanvantēy hal, tō kē melep van hiy nisil.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Net vanvantēy hal en, ikē Mosis. Exodus 19.</char></note> Tō Nele mavan tabay me den Ḡod. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Hēywē so net vanvantēy hal mavan me den ige nam̄adeg, ba Ḡod ikē vitwag woy.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />?Wō nele gōh niakak tavatvale mi navatvat non Ḡod? !Ō-ō-ō, tateh! So nele vitwag wo telep vēh nēh van hiy net, nēdēmdēm nan so gēn so tavan togolgol vēh lengon Ḡod heylō Nele. Ba Ḡod et lep te nele qelenen van hiy net. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ba Nayapyap Yon̄ niak m̄ōleg so ige del telemyam notog leln̄e vēvēg begengenyeg nonoy, qeleso kēy notog lēm̄ yētyēt. Ba navatvat bēdēmtig hiy Tigsas Kraēs tavan vēh hiy ige a nēdēmtig kē. <verse eid="GAL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Me am̄ag, mahē a nēdēmdēm ne dēmtig et van qete me en, Nele gōh mēyēt kemem del wa mitigoy kemem, tō kemem motog qelenen gaydēn̄ a Ḡod melep lō me nēdēmdēm ne dēmtig.<verse eid="GAL 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Bastō Nele qeleso net bēlēl tegoy gēn. Nele mēlēl tegoy gēn van dēn̄ a Kraēs mavan me. Ak tō so gēn nētēymat so dēmtig kē, tō van togolgol lengon Ḡod. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Togtōkē nēdēmdēm ne dēmtig mal van me, tō kemem et tog site van laln̄an net bēlēl tegoy agōh.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Kimi del mukēg kē veg kimi mal van me yantēntēn Ḡod heylō nēdēmtig van hiy Tigsas Kraēs. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Veg kimi del a mal vasugyon̄ en, kimi nuqul tiwag van mi Kraēs, veg kimi mal lep Kraēs qeleso kimi meheygoy kimi mi namalmal.<verse eid="GAL 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Tateh hap tegha se so niak vēlwoy kimi. Wa tateh hap tegha se so niaklō so kimi Juw wa yatkelgi et Juw te. Yatkelgi neslev wa yatkelgi et slev te, yatkel et tam̄an wa yatkel et lōqōvēn, tateh. Kimi del mal qultiwag mi Tigsas Kraēs, tō kimi mal van me vitwag woy. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Ba Kimi sowo ige nonon Kraēs, tō kimi mavan tabay me den Abraham. Tō kimi telep vēh vel haphap a Ḡod mavatvat tō van hiy Abraham.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Net slev siso nēnētm̄ey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Nēdēmdēm ne hohole mino gōh qelegēn. Dēm tow van hiy net vitwag a ēntēn aē. Net nan nim̄ōk net tegha so nietgoy ēntēn. Tō vaga net tegha nan nivatvatne ēntēn, ak tō so namtevun nitnenen. Ēntēn en, ikē qeleso neslev van hiy net nan, et matak te van aē so me atgiy ēntēn tilwo goy nahaphap del non itman. Me atgiy en kē telep vēh nage del den imam nonon, ba qiyig gōh kē et liwo goy qete nahaphap nan. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Veg net bēlēl tegoy aē, tō kē tetgoy vēh vel haphap del nonon, gaydēn̄ mahē a imam nonon mepnog tō aē.<verse eid="GAL 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Am̄ag, mahē a igēn nētnētm̄ey en, igēn ige slev. Namanig nan, mahē Kraēs tateh qete, nahap telemyam gōh nam̄agoy gēn, qeleso nele a mavan me den nēdēmdēm non net, siso nuvu het. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ba mavan togolgol me lamahē a Ḡod mepnog tō aē, tō kē qoyo vētleg me Ēntēn. Nēnētm̄ey gōh mowot me den nalqōvēn vitwag, tō metgoy liwo kē laln̄e Le. <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />Kē mavan me tō so niwēl yak gēn a notog laln̄e Le, tō Ḡod nisolyak gēn. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Veg kimi ige yantēntēn, tō Ḡod mēvētleg me Nuvu non Ēntēn so nitog tiwag me lelo taqangēn. Tō Nuvu gōh niōlōl so, “!Imam, Imam!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Bastō am̄ag en nēk neslev, ba heylō Ḡod en, togtōkē nēk mal van me ēntēn, tō nēk telep vēh vel haphap a Ḡod mavatvat tō van hiy nēk.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol memgaysēn ige Taḡalasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Am̄ag, kimi et ēglal te Ḡod en, tō kimi ige slev nonon nahap qiyig telemyam a kēy et ḡod te, ikē noḡod galgal. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ba togtōkē, kimi mal ēglal Ḡod. Tō nok so vap qelegēn so, togtōkē Ḡod mal ēglal kimi. ?Bahap tō kimi nemyōs so van lok van hiy nahap qiyig a kēy mewelan goy tō kimi am̄ag ōk? Namaymay nonon tateh hōnqal, wa tō kēy tit lep vēhte nahap vitwag van hiy kimi. ?Bahap tō kimi nemyōs so van me ige slev nonoy lokse? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />?Bahap tō kimi nemyōs so van me ige slev ne vēnan ige Juw? !Veg kimi dēmap nōqōn̄ yon̄, nōwōl yon̄, wa nēte yon̄ nonoy!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pol nihole gatay nōqōn̄ yon̄ non ige Juw, qele Nōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg, qōn̄ non nōwōl gayaq, wa nōqōn̄ qeleanen.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Yēhē, kimi mak mētēgteg no. !Nok dēm van so nok mugumgu yeghuquy ēwē van hiy kimi!<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Yathithik wa yatētētek, mahē a no mavatēp kimi en, no mavan me qele kimi, nok et dēmdēm te van bēvēnan ige Juw. Tō nok vēhge kimi so van me qele ino. Hēywē, kimi mak tō nēwē me hiy no. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Kimi mal ēglal vatag so am̄ag, no mavan me motog tiwag mi kimi veg no mogom, ba mahē nen no mavasemlō noyoy ēwē gōh van hiy kimi. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ba nogom mino gōh mak memeh kimi, ba kimi et yon̄teg te nehet aē veg no, wa tō kimi et dēmdēm hethet te veg no. Kimi melep vasgēt no lēm̄ nonmi, qeleso ino nin̄sel non Ḡod, si ino Tigsas Kraēs. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />No tavap vēh qelegēn, kimi nemyōs so wikil yak namtami ba leh namtek aē, ba kimi akak lēlēge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nohohole bemtege nivasemlō so ige Taḡalasia nemyōs yeh so biyin̄ Pol. Pol wun mogom veg namtan nehet.</char></note> Am̄ag, kimi memlaklak tō. ?Ba togtōkē, qeleave? <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />No mohole nēhēyhēywē vēlēs van hiy kimi. ?Ba nēhēyhēywē wun mak nehet hiy kimi? ?Tō kimi dēm so no matvale tiwag mi kimi?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Ige nen a kēy tog walēg tō kimi en, nēdēmdēm nonoy namaymay veg kimi, ba nēdēmdēm nonoy et wē te. Veg kēy nemyōs so gatgoy kimi, so kimi dēmdēm vēlēs hiy kēy. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Hēyhēywē, so net niak hiy kimi qelegōh mi nēdēmdēm mey a itōk en, nitiy wē yeh, so wo no aē mi kimi si so tateh. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Ige nēnētm̄ey susu mino, nok yon̄memeh veg kimi, qele nalqōvēn niyon̄memeh so kē nilep ēntēn, gaydēn̄ a kimi lep nēh non Kraēs van lēh nonmi. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />!No nitiy mōyōs so nok tog tiwag mi kimi qiyig agōh, tō so leh nohohole maymay mino van lohohole malkōh! ?No tak qeleave van hiy kimi?<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nakaka veg Hega kōyō Sera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Kimi mey a nemyōs so matēg van hiy Nele, atmi vulu no. ?Wō kimi mal yon̄teg vatag nahap a Nele gōh nivayēg ōk, si kimi et yon̄teg qete? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Nohohole Yon̄ mohole gatay yoge nētnētm̄ey tam̄an nonon Abraham, vitwag mowot me den nalqōvēn a kē neslev, bastō vitwag mowot me den ēgnōn a kē notog wawah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 16</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Nēnētm̄ey mey a mowot me den nalqōvēn neslev, kē mowot me qele ige nētnētm̄ey del en. Ba nēnētm̄ey mey a mowot me den ēgnōn a kē notog wawah en, kē mowot me veg Ḡod mavatvat tō aē.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ba gēn telep vēh nakaka gōh qeleso navap tēngeg. Yoge lōqōvēn gōh niaklō me hiy gēn nakavanan vōyō a Ḡod mohohole tō van hiy ige Juw. Nakavanan vitwag veg Nele a Ḡod melep van hiy ige Juw luwutwut Sinai, nēdēmdēm nan qele Hega. Ige yantēntēn Hega en, kēy ige slev, kēy et tog wawah hōn te. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Bastō Hega gōh qeleso Nuwutwut Sinai, n̄a Arabia, tō kē nitig leh ige Tejerusalem a togtō agōh. Ikē tiwag mi ige nonon, kēy ige slev vēlēs.<verse eid="GAL 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ba Sera, ikē qeleso Jerusalem mey netegha. Jerusalem nan n̄a lōtōk, wa ikē notog wawah, tō ikē tita nongēn. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Veg Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Inēk gōh am̄ag, nēk et visipsis te, ba itōk so nēk malaklak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Inēk gōh am̄ag, nēk et yon̄memeh te beleplep nētm̄ey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">tō itōk so nēk ōlōltawtaw wa sese neh bemlaklak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">nēk et leplep nētm̄ey hōn te ba togtōkē yantinti a nam̄adeg tododoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">nehep den nalqōvēn a ēgnōn notogtog tiwag lap mi kē qeleanen.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 54:1</char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Yathithik wa yatētētek, kimi yantēntēn Ḡod veg kē mavatvat tō aē veg kimi, qele kē mavatvat tō am̄ag veg Isak. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ismael mowot namun me qele ige nētnētm̄ey del, ba Isak mowot namun me heylō Nuvu non Ḡod. Ismael makaksok tiwag mi Isak, tō nēmētvuge qelegōh lapgetō gaydēn̄ qiyig agōh. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />?Ba Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap qeleave? Kē mavap so, “Nēk so vōyyak nalqōvēn slev nen tiwag mi ēntēn, kōyō vayak den mahē agōh. Veg ēntēn nalqōvēn slev nen tit m̄agm̄agoy vēhte nahaphap non imam nonon. Nahaphap del geh nen nivan hiy ēntēn nalqōvēn a nawawah.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 21</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Bastō igēn gōh, et yantēntēn nalqōvēn slev te, ba igēn yantēntēn nalqōvēn a nawawah.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Ige non Kraēs, kēy nataywah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kraēs mukēg wawah gēn tō so gēn tog m̄ōleg galgalsi. Tō atmi tig maymay lap. Nitog so kimi van lokse me neslev.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />!Atmi yon̄teg, ino Pol, a nok vap van hiy kimi! So kimi wo mukēg kimi van so tep kimi, tatag van Lele en, tō Kraēs tit biyin̄ hōnqal vēhte kimi. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Nok so vap maymay lokse van hiy kimi. So net vitwag den kimi wo mukēg kēy van so tep vēglal kē, tō kē mas ak vel haphap a Nele mavayēg van kē. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />So kimi wo mamatēg van hiy Nele so kimi tenenen van lengon Ḡod en, tō kimi mahgemi tototyak kimi den Kraēs, tō nasgōp teqlen̄ den kimi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ba kemem en, kemem titig apwo dēmtig, heylō Luvu. Tō kemem temlaklak so dēyē so Ḡod niak tenenen kemem.<verse eid="GAL 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Kemem nētēy lap nēdēmtig, veg nēdēmtig nitiy wē yeh. Mahē gēn muqul tiwag van mi Kraēs Tigsas en, et tiykē yeh te sowo kēy mal tep vēglal gēn si et tep vēglal te gēn. Nitiykē yeh en, nēdēmtig mey a nemn̄ēs goy natamtam.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Mahē a kimi moyon̄teg noyoy ēwē am̄ag en, qeleso kimi meskiyak valeh, tō sisqet so kimi lalaket. ?Ba entō gōh, nahap meteygoy kimi? ?Ihē mihigoy kimi, tō kimi et tatag te nohohole hēyhēywē gōh? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Mey gōhkē et dēmdēm non Ḡod te, a mal ōlōl vatag kimi. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Etgoy galsi kimi den navatvatne het bele, veg “nis a nusu en, kē nigaleg naflawa liwo nisis.” <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Ba heylō Welan no nēdēmtig so kimi toyon̄teg wa tokokm̄egoy nēdēmdēm mino. Tō ihēte a niakak hethet kimi en, Ḡod telep van nēvēvēg hiy kē aē.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Yathithik wa yatētētek, dēm tow van hiy ige mey a nemyōs so tep vēglal kimi. Am̄ag, mahē a no et dēmtig qete Kraēs en, no nemgugoy kēy. So nok wo toytoy lapgetō so tep vēglal net en, togtō kēy tit ak memeh vēhte no. Sowo qelenen en, togtō mahē nok hohole gatay namatmat non Kraēs apwo wolwol en, tit ak hethet vēhte nēdēmdēm nonoy. Ba nok et mugugoy te kēy, tō kimi nēglal vatag so kēy akak memeh lapgetō no. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />!Ba no nemyōs so ige mey a kēy nemyōs so tep kimi en, nitiy wē yeh so kēy wot lok kēy mahgey!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nataqn̄ige nemyōs so dam namtevuge mey nehet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Yathithik wa yatētētek, Ḡod may ōlōl yak kimi so van taywah. Ba kimi et van taywah te so dam nēdēmdēm bataqn̄ige<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Navap a ‘nataqn̄ige’ en, Pol nihole gatay namyōs het non net, nahap het a nataqn̄ige nemyōs. Ba Nuvu Yon̄ et mōyōste namyōs ne taqn̄ige nan.</char></note> mey nehet, ba kimi so vēy biyin̄ kimi vaga, veg kimi notog vēy tamtam kimi. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Nele vitwag niaktig Nele tegtegha del. Nohohole nan qelegēn so, “Atmi tam ige a kēy notog walēg kimi qele nēk tam lok nēk mahge.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Leviticus 19:18</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ba kimi sowo motogtog vēyvēygēl en, tō kimi qeleso notok, a kēy vēy n̄itn̄it lok hiy kēy mahgey. Tō kimi tiple doldoldendel lok kimi.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Bastō nok vap van hiy kimi, van tatag Nuvu Yon̄. Sowo kimi wo matatag Nuvu, tō kimi tit ak vēhte nahaphap het a nataqn̄ige nemyōs. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Veg nataqn̄ige nēvēyvēygēl tiwag mi Nuvu Yon̄, wa Nuvu Yon̄ nēvēyvēygēl tiwag mi nataqn̄ige, veg kōyō natvale. Tō bege gōh en kimi tit ak vēhte nahaphap mey kimi namyōs. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ba Nuvu Yon̄ wo mitig helem̄ag kimi en, Nele tit tigoy vēhte kimi.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Ige del tēglal so namyōs nitaqn̄ige en nahap; togay het, legleg hethet, legleg solosloteg, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />mogmogo goy ḡod tegtegha, hewhew mat net, togtog tavatvale, vēvēhyuw, qeneqneg, boboel, sosotel, nēvēyvēygēl memeh, togtog vēlvēlwoy, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />inin qaqa memeh, akak tēqtēqyeg, wa tō yatkel haphap mey a et wē te. Tō nok vap lō togolgol van hiy kimi yipteg agōh, qele no mavap tō van hiy kimi am̄ag. Ige mey a kēy akak qelenen en, Ḡod tit mayanag goy vēhte kēy.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ba nēwe Vu Yon̄ en, ikē natamtam, namlaklak, natm̄at, namhuy, naln̄e magaysēn, wē mi net, dēmtig, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />dēmbēbēw. Wa tō Nuvu Yon̄ nivatne nēk so etgoy nēmētwu so nitnenen vaga. Wa tō naln̄e tigoy nahaphap het. Tateh le so nitigoy kimi den nage geh agōh. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Ige non Tigsas Kraēs en, kēy mal ukēg veteg nēdēmdēm hethet a nikalō me den nataqn̄ige. Qeleso kēy mal wos nataqn̄ige van lowolwol. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Atmi et Nuvu Yon̄ gōh, kē mal lep vatag me nēh hiy gēn. Veg bege gōh en, gēn so van tatag kē. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Nehet so gēn sosotel gēn si keskes yak vēygēl si vēy qeneqneg gēn.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Vel et so niywu nahaphap dēw namun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Yathithik wa yatētētek, so vitwag den kimi wo misisgoy, tō kimi mey a Nuvu non Ḡod aē mi kimi en, atmi biyin̄ kē, tō so lom tenenen kē, a lemtehal mey a nemlumlum. Ba atmi etgoy galgalsi kimi, kimi tiple sisgoy. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Kimi so vēy biyin̄ kimi so yuwu bevel haphap het a wo maqal kimi. Lēdēmdēm qelegōh en, tō kimi tak tatag qēt nele non Kraēs.<verse eid="GAL 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />So net vitwag wo mēdēmdēm so, “Ino itōk veteg net tegha,” ba kē net yeghuquy ēwē, kē nigalgal lok kē mahgen. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Velvel et so niēglal galgalsi namtevōn mahgen so qeleave. Tō kē tēsēsē vēh kē aē, ba nitog dēmdēm van bemtevōn net tegha. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Veg vel et vivitwag so niywu nahaphap dēw namuy.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gēn nitog n̄ayn̄ay den nahaphap mey nēwē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Ige a notog leptō leln̄e vatvatne lohohole non Ḡod en, itōk so kēy gasēg nahaphap del mey nēwē tiwag mi ige vatvatgo nonoy.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Atmi nitog qaqa en. Tateh et tagal vēh Ḡod, tō nahap te mey a net nivah en, nahap nan kē telep lok. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Veg net wo mavah nahapte a nataqn̄ige<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Navap nataqn̄ige, lohohole non Pol nēdēmdēm nan so nahaphap mey nehet a nēdēmdēm nongēn nemyōs en, mey a kē natvale goy vel haphap a Nuvu Yon̄ nemyōs.</char></note> nemyōs en, kē telep lok namatmat aē den nataqn̄ige. Ba net wo mavah nahapte a Nuvu nemyōs en, kē telep lok nēh lap aē den Nuvu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Tō gēn nitog n̄ayn̄ay den nahaphap mey nēwē a gēn akak en. Veg gēn telep nayseyse aē litiy qōn̄ nan sowo gēn nitog m̄egeygey. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Bastō, nitiy wē yeh so gēn ak nahaphap mey nēwē so biyin̄ ige del aē, so gēn wo tak vēh. Yakhag yeh veg yathēthēngēn wa yatētētangēn a kēy nēdēmtig Kraēs.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babah ne hohole so hole matyak kēy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Atmi et neletes lililwo mino, no mayap mahgēk van nohohole gōh.<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Yatkel vatvatgo nemyōs so qeqet kimi van so tep vēglal kimi. Ba kēy nemyōs ēwē so ige Tisrael so vesveshiy kēy bataqn̄imi. Kēy akak qelenen veg kēy mētēgteg so ige Juw so ak tōqtōqyeg kēy mahē a kēy toytoy gatay namatmat non Kraēs apwo wolwol.<verse eid="GAL 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ige a mal hel kēy nen, kēy et tatag te Nele. Ba kēy nemyōs so qēyēt kimi van so hel kimi, tō kēy tohole sotel kēy veg nataqn̄imi. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ba veg no en, no tohole sotel vēh no veg bege vitwag ēwē, veg a bamatmat nonon Tigsas Kraēs, Welan nongēn, a kē mamat lowolwol. Heylō nowolwol non Kraēs en, nok at yak den namyam, tō namyam niat yak den no.<verse eid="GAL 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Veg et tiy ikē yeh te sowo mal hel vēglal net siso et hel vēglal te kē. Nitiy ikē yeh en, so Ḡod mak gayaq kē. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Nok tatay so natm̄at wa namgaysēn non Ḡod nitog tiwag mi ige del a kēy tatag namtehal nen, tiwag mi ige Tisrael non Ḡod.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Nitog so net niak tēktēk lokse no. Veg namtewot vatag aē lataybēk a nivasemlō so ino net non Tigsas.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pol nihole gatay namtewot a kēy muwuh tō kē am̄ag veg kē motoytoy veg Kraēs.</char></note><verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Yēhē yathithik wa yatētētek, nasgōp non Welan nongēn Tigsas Kraēs notog tiwag mi kimi del. Qeleanen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>